# Floodpits Drowner: if the target creature is an illegal target as the ability tries to resolve, it doesn't resolve and none
# of its effects happen - the Drowner is not shuffled either (CR 608.2b, and the ruling). Bot1 activates it targeting the
# stunned Llanowar Elves; Bot2 Lightning Bolts its own Elves in response. The Drowner stays on the battlefield (tapped for
# the cost), the Elves are in Bot2's graveyard, and neither library changed.

